WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.830
<b>YEAR OF 1334 - HALF A YEAR SINCE
THE SHOGUNATE WAS DESTROYED</b>

00:02.920 --> 00:05.630
<b>TOKIYUKI HOJO, FIRST NEW YEAR
SINCE LIVING IN HIDING IN SUWA</b>

00:07.130 --> 00:09.420
<b>Slowly. Slowly.</b>

00:10.010 --> 00:11.720
<b>We're almost there, my lord.</b>

00:15.010 --> 00:16.050
<b>Here we are.</b>

00:19.100 --> 00:21.230
<b>Wow.</b>

00:24.520 --> 00:27.770
<b>What do you think, my lord?
It's all frozen.</b>

00:28.270 --> 00:31.070
<b>You can play anywhere on Lake Suwa
in the winter.</b>

00:32.190 --> 00:33.200
<b>Amazing…</b>

00:34.280 --> 00:35.280
<b>My lord!</b>

00:37.070 --> 00:39.160
<b>Are you okay, my lord?</b>

00:39.240 --> 00:40.580
<b>Young Lord, you okay?</b>

00:49.670 --> 00:51.510
<b>Man. That scared me.</b>

00:57.720 --> 01:00.760
<b><i>It's been half a year since</i>
<i>the Kamakura shogunate was destroyed.</i></b>

01:00.850 --> 01:04.140
<b><i>Tokiyuki ushered in his first new year</i>
<i>in Suwa.</i></b>

01:05.730 --> 01:10.270
<b><i>Tumultuous times were put to rest</i>
<i>for the moment,</i></b>

01:10.360 --> 01:14.150
<b>-<i>but there were still small skirmishes.</i>
-Young Lord! You can do it! Go, go!</b>

01:14.650 --> 01:19.370
<b><i>Suwa's peace was bound</i>
<i>to be disrupted too.</i></b>

01:25.410 --> 01:26.420
<b>Here it comes.</b>

01:27.000 --> 01:29.460
<b>That phase when I can't see the future.</b>

01:33.010 --> 01:35.720
<b>THE ELUSIVE
SAMURAI</b>

02:55.340 --> 02:59.970
<b>THE ELUSIVE
SAMURAI</b>

03:02.800 --> 03:04.510
<b>SHINANO GOVERNOR'S RESIDENCE</b>

03:04.600 --> 03:08.600
<b>I've obtained a new territory.</b>

03:08.680 --> 03:13.020
<b>I need someone like you.
A man of great force, Shokan.</b>

03:13.110 --> 03:14.820
<b>SHOKAN</b>

03:14.900 --> 03:19.530
<b>I hear you were feared like a demon
because you were a scoundrel.</b>

03:21.200 --> 03:23.870
<b>To say I'm a scoundrel
is taking it too far.</b>

03:23.950 --> 03:26.030
<b>I've changed my ways.</b>

03:26.120 --> 03:30.870
<b>Lord Sadamune, you are on the rise,
and so I have chosen to serve you.</b>

03:30.960 --> 03:36.340
<b>I've been instructed
to take Suwa's territory piece by piece.</b>

03:36.420 --> 03:38.670
<b>I'm the one for the job</b>

03:40.340 --> 03:45.760
<b>because taking from others is
what I live for.</b>

03:49.310 --> 03:51.390
<b>Is that all right, Sadamune?</b>

03:53.350 --> 03:54.350
<b>KING</b>

03:54.440 --> 03:57.270
<b>I need more strong men in our clan.</b>

04:00.240 --> 04:05.700
<b>I can't win in these turbulent times
if I'm following warriors' codes.</b>

04:08.540 --> 04:11.830
<b>Ogasawara is moving suspiciously
yet again.</b>

04:11.910 --> 04:16.340
<b>Yes. The enemy seems to be spying on us
from the northern border.</b>

04:16.420 --> 04:17.420
<b>KING</b>

04:17.500 --> 04:19.630
<b>Send a scout!</b>

04:20.800 --> 04:24.300
<b>The skilled scout has already
been sent elsewhere.</b>

04:24.380 --> 04:27.430
<b>The situation on the western border
is precarious as well.</b>

04:28.470 --> 04:30.470
<b><i>I must hide this secret from everyone.</i></b>

04:30.560 --> 04:34.770
<b><i>On rare occasions,</i>
<i>I suddenly lose my gift of prophecy.</i></b>

04:35.480 --> 04:40.320
<b><i>This is bad. I hope there's no trouble</i>
<i>during a time like this.</i></b>

04:40.400 --> 04:45.490
<b>Um… What do you say the Elusive Warriors
go to scout out the area?</b>

04:47.070 --> 04:48.660
<b>What?</b>

04:50.200 --> 04:52.700
<b>Young Lord! You are so reliable!</b>

04:52.790 --> 04:55.460
<b>Just as I would expect from
the future leader of this warrior family!</b>

04:55.540 --> 04:56.920
<b>Please go, Young Lord!</b>

04:57.000 --> 04:58.880
<b>-What? Wait.
-The Young Lord will be competent.</b>

04:58.960 --> 05:01.300
<b>That's dangerous.
If anything were to happen,</b>

05:01.380 --> 05:03.800
<b>-the Hojo bloodline could end.
-This is wonderful. Just as you'd expect!</b>

05:03.880 --> 05:05.380
<b>Don't worry.</b>

05:05.470 --> 05:08.140
<b>No one will suspect children on their own,</b>

05:08.220 --> 05:11.220
<b>and you know better than anyone
of my ability to run away.</b>

05:11.310 --> 05:13.180
<b>-Yes.
-Yeah, but…</b>

05:13.980 --> 05:18.520
<b>Excellent idea! Kojiro and Ayako, you have
experience scouting a number of times,</b>

05:18.610 --> 05:20.440
<b>and the local civilians will be at peace</b>

05:20.520 --> 05:22.820
<b>with the well-mannered Lord Tokiyuki
in tow.</b>

05:22.900 --> 05:25.740
<b>Let's go with this plan, Lord Yorishige!</b>

05:25.820 --> 05:27.110
<b>Lord Yorishige!</b>

05:27.200 --> 05:28.200
<b>Lord Yorishige!</b>

05:28.280 --> 05:30.160
<b>Lord Yorishige!</b>

05:30.240 --> 05:34.040
<b>No. If bandits kill him on the way,
the bloodline will end.</b>

05:34.120 --> 05:37.750
<b>Ayako and I can protect him from bandits.</b>

05:37.830 --> 05:40.040
<b>The lord can also escape with an assist
from Genba's trickery.</b>

05:40.130 --> 05:41.040
<b>You called?</b>

05:41.630 --> 05:45.670
<b>Well, if he gets lost in the woods,
the bloodline will end.</b>

05:45.760 --> 05:50.140
<b>These past six months, I went on several
long horse rides within Suwa territory.</b>

05:50.220 --> 05:52.680
<b>I can make my way back from anywhere
in Suwa!</b>

05:53.270 --> 05:57.310
<b>No. What if he eats a slug
on the roadside, and a parasite kills him?</b>

05:57.390 --> 05:58.770
<b>MUMBLE MUMBLE</b>

05:58.850 --> 06:02.400
<b>What if he passes by a sultry woman
and dies of a nosebleed?</b>

06:04.230 --> 06:06.110
<b>What if he remembers
something embarrassing from the past</b>

06:06.200 --> 06:09.240
<b>-and dies of shock?
-I want to die.</b>

06:09.320 --> 06:11.160
<b>What is wrong with you?</b>

06:11.740 --> 06:13.830
<b>There's something up with you today,
Mr. Yorishige.</b>

06:13.910 --> 06:17.710
<b>You're usually calm
when you send me to dangerous places.</b>

06:17.790 --> 06:22.250
<b>We're getting nowhere.
Can we go now, Lord Moritaka?</b>

06:22.790 --> 06:26.050
<b>Yes. This is currently the best option.</b>

06:26.760 --> 06:29.090
<b>Remember, the Young Lord's safety
is your top priority.</b>

06:29.180 --> 06:30.390
<b>-You got it.
-Understood!</b>

06:30.470 --> 06:34.140
<b>Hey, wait a second! Lord Tokiyuki
isn't actually a great escape artist!</b>

06:34.220 --> 06:37.430
<b>He's just a big weirdo
who gets off on running away!</b>

06:37.940 --> 06:38.940
<b>That's so rude!</b>

06:42.520 --> 06:45.400
<b>Now, how should we prepare to scout?</b>

06:45.900 --> 06:47.530
<b>We should pack lightly.</b>

06:48.150 --> 06:51.280
<b>Food for two days and
some traveling expenses should be plenty.</b>

06:51.370 --> 06:54.120
<b>I want to bring as much money as possible.</b>

06:54.200 --> 06:57.500
<b>Let's trick Moritaka and swindle him.</b>

06:57.580 --> 07:00.080
<b>Genba, you always say things like that.</b>

07:01.000 --> 07:04.420
<b>We shouldn't use
rice and money excessively.</b>

07:04.500 --> 07:07.630
<b>LORD TOKIYUKI
MUST TAKE</b>

07:11.470 --> 07:15.060
<b><i>Yorishige is staring.</i></b>

07:16.060 --> 07:19.640
<b><i>He is staring with concern.</i></b>

07:20.560 --> 07:21.650
<b>Father!</b>

07:22.600 --> 07:24.440
<b>You know.</b>

07:24.520 --> 07:28.400
<b>If Lord Tokiyuki starves to death,
his bloodline will end…</b>

07:29.700 --> 07:31.070
<b>Let's ignore him and go.</b>

07:31.150 --> 07:32.700
<b>Yeah, let's hurry!</b>

07:37.450 --> 07:39.580
<b>This should be enough to keep me warm.</b>

07:40.160 --> 07:43.880
<b>Shizuku's special cotton-laid kimono
is warm, of course.</b>

07:43.960 --> 07:46.250
<b>Just one layer is all I need.</b>

07:46.340 --> 07:49.670
<b>Lighter clothing is less suspicious
and it makes it easier to run away.</b>

07:52.380 --> 07:53.300
<b>CHARCOAL</b>

07:53.390 --> 07:54.390
<b>What?</b>

07:58.680 --> 08:01.810
<b><i>Yorishige is staring.</i></b>

08:03.270 --> 08:05.060
<b><i>He's staring like the owner…</i></b>

08:05.150 --> 08:06.360
<b>NAMASTE - OPEN
SERVING CHILLED BEER</b>

08:07.190 --> 08:08.610
<b><i>…of an empty curry restaurant.</i></b>

08:09.610 --> 08:12.740
<b>You're acting really weird today,
Mr. Yorishige!</b>

08:12.820 --> 08:14.740
<b>Well, if you freeze to death</b>

08:14.820 --> 08:18.200
<b>or if there are one million enemy soldiers
waiting for you, the bloodline, you know?</b>

08:18.290 --> 08:22.250
<b>Bloodline, bloodline, bloodline.</b>

08:22.330 --> 08:24.080
<b>Does he have an obsession with bloodlines?</b>

08:25.460 --> 08:27.040
<b>Ugh.</b>

08:27.130 --> 08:28.340
<b>What was all that about?</b>

08:28.960 --> 08:31.420
<b>He gets like that sometimes.</b>

08:32.170 --> 08:33.180
<b>Like what?</b>

08:33.760 --> 08:36.680
<b>He starts to worry and becomes irritable.</b>

08:36.760 --> 08:39.680
<b><i>Who ate my mochi? Who?</i></b>

08:40.430 --> 08:44.730
<b>He would fatten up with just water.
Or he would eat only sour things.</b>

08:44.810 --> 08:46.690
<b>Is he pregnant or what?</b>

08:47.480 --> 08:49.610
<b>What in the world is he thinking?</b>

08:50.440 --> 08:51.440
<b>Who knows.</b>

08:53.530 --> 08:57.450
<b>-He's always pushing me around, but…
-Lord Tokiyuki! Be careful.</b>

09:00.160 --> 09:03.910
<b>It makes me kinda happy
that he's seeing me off with such worry.</b>

09:24.350 --> 09:26.900
<b>NAKAYAMA MANOR
(SUWA TERRITORY'S NORTHERN POINT)</b>

09:27.810 --> 09:30.020
<b>We got here just before sunset.</b>

09:30.570 --> 09:32.280
<b>It seems peaceful.</b>

09:32.360 --> 09:34.650
<b>Let me go over our plan.</b>

09:34.740 --> 09:37.240
<b>We are still in Suwa territory,</b>

09:37.320 --> 09:40.450
<b>but we don't have much information about
our location since it's on the far edge.</b>

09:40.950 --> 09:44.830
<b>So first, we'll gather information
as messengers of Suwa Grand Shrine.</b>

09:44.910 --> 09:47.500
<b>Tomorrow,
we'll take a look around the village.</b>

09:48.130 --> 09:52.670
<b>We'll see if it looks like enemies
will come, and if so, when and how many.</b>

09:53.460 --> 09:56.550
<b>If the village ever needs to be protected,
we'll figure out how many soldiers</b>

09:56.630 --> 09:58.050
<b>we'll need and report back…</b>

10:14.940 --> 10:15.860
<b>What is this?</b>

10:16.570 --> 10:17.860
<b>We're surrounded.</b>

10:25.000 --> 10:29.580
<b>What's up with this village?
Has it already fallen to the enemy?</b>

10:34.960 --> 10:38.510
<b><i>He is a dual-wielder in his mid-teens.</i></b>

10:39.550 --> 10:41.970
<b><i>When will the ones surrounding us</i>
<i>join the fight?</i></b>

10:58.450 --> 10:59.400
<b><i>He's fast.</i></b>

10:59.910 --> 11:02.320
<b><i>His swordsmanship is terrific</i>
<i>even at his young age.</i></b>

11:02.990 --> 11:06.370
<b>Hey, fighting is outside
my area of expertise.</b>

11:06.450 --> 11:08.080
<b>Let's get out of here while we can, brat.</b>

11:08.160 --> 11:12.000
<b>Those two can only buy time
if they're up against that dual-wielder.</b>

11:14.210 --> 11:18.880
<b><i>No, those two have gotten much stronger</i>
<i>since half a year ago!</i></b>

11:20.050 --> 11:22.430
<b>Even then, their speed and strength</b>

11:22.510 --> 11:25.260
<b>are completely different
from when they were training with me!</b>

11:26.100 --> 11:27.310
<b>That means…</b>

11:27.980 --> 11:28.810
<b>Back then…</b>

11:31.400 --> 11:32.810
<b><i>You're doin' it, my lord!</i></b>

11:33.520 --> 11:36.360
<b><i>You're winning one out of five times!</i></b>

11:38.070 --> 11:40.950
<b><i>You'll regret it one day</i>
<i>if you're always underestimating me.</i></b>

11:42.570 --> 11:43.530
<b><i>Wow.</i></b>

11:44.660 --> 11:47.490
<b><i>If I keep training with you,</i>
<i>you'll surpass me.</i></b>

11:48.080 --> 11:50.500
<b><i>I can't be too careless.</i></b>

11:51.170 --> 11:54.460
<b><i>So, that means that other time, too?</i></b>

11:56.880 --> 11:58.300
<b><i>Young Lord, you're good.</i></b>

11:58.380 --> 12:01.550
<b><i>Our swords are locked</i>
<i>and you're pushing me.</i></b>

12:01.630 --> 12:04.140
<b><i>It's because you've been training me.</i></b>

12:05.640 --> 12:10.890
<b><i>By the time we're adults,</i>
<i>I might be the one protecting you.</i></b>

12:11.390 --> 12:12.810
<b>AWWWW</b>

12:14.400 --> 12:16.900
<b><i>I want to see a strong Young Lord soon.</i></b>

12:17.570 --> 12:22.200
<b><i>There you go. One more push.</i>
<i>You got it. You got it.</i></b>

12:23.910 --> 12:25.910
<b><i>They were both totally babying me.</i></b>

12:26.450 --> 12:28.080
<b>You should've known right then and there.</b>

12:29.750 --> 12:31.750
<b>Kojiro. Ayako.</b>

12:32.790 --> 12:36.040
<b>Lord Tokiyuki's elusiveness
is not always reliable.</b>

12:36.670 --> 12:39.710
<b>Because of his peaceful personality,
he lets his guard down.</b>

12:40.300 --> 12:42.590
<b>And there are
plenty of attacks he still can't avoid.</b>

12:43.470 --> 12:49.310
<b>Enemy attacks from seasoned war veterans,
from those with unusual powers,</b>

12:49.390 --> 12:51.980
<b>or from warriors
who try to surpass the limits of humanity.</b>

12:52.850 --> 12:54.520
<b>Up against those monsters,</b>

12:55.020 --> 12:58.020
<b>there's no guarantee
that Lord Tokiyuki can outrun them.</b>

12:59.070 --> 13:01.070
<b>So the two of you
should not let your guard down,</b>

13:01.150 --> 13:03.530
<b>and you should continue
to become stronger samurai.</b>

13:04.360 --> 13:08.160
<b>So you can protect the lord's life
from any enemy.</b>

13:13.830 --> 13:17.460
<b><i>What brave and strongly devoted retainers.</i></b>

13:18.290 --> 13:22.340
<b><i>If I also fight boldly, then one day…</i></b>

13:29.180 --> 13:31.640
<b>Could it be… Shizuku?</b>

13:33.600 --> 13:38.360
<b>Did you forget?
You fed me in east Shinano once.</b>

13:43.070 --> 13:44.240
<b>Fubuki?</b>

13:45.400 --> 13:47.110
<b>Please excuse my rudeness.</b>

13:47.950 --> 13:50.870
<b>I got the sense those two were beasts,</b>

13:51.490 --> 13:54.330
<b>so I thought
they were enemy spies in disguise.</b>

13:54.410 --> 13:55.660
<b>-What?
-What?</b>

13:55.750 --> 13:57.790
<b>My name is Fubuki.</b>

13:58.460 --> 14:01.460
<b>I wander the land
looking for a lord to serve.</b>

14:02.460 --> 14:05.470
<b>So you're not from this village?</b>

14:05.970 --> 14:09.720
<b>Correct. Three days ago,
I stopped by to request a meal,</b>

14:11.050 --> 14:14.310
<b>but I saw fighters with Ogasawara's
standards had raided this area,</b>

14:14.390 --> 14:15.350
<b>so I aided the locals.</b>

14:22.190 --> 14:24.740
<b>Platoons of about the same size
came three times.</b>

14:24.820 --> 14:27.570
<b>I managed to defeat them,
but my supplies were almost out.</b>

14:27.650 --> 14:29.660
<b>I was in a pinch
since I didn't even have a horse</b>

14:29.740 --> 14:31.490
<b>to communicate with the outside world.</b>

14:32.580 --> 14:34.410
<b>You took down three platoons…</b>

14:34.490 --> 14:38.040
<b>And the villagers are holding
torches, waiting and watching?</b>

14:39.120 --> 14:42.880
<b>Letting a young outsider fight?
How cowardly.</b>

14:43.380 --> 14:45.920
<b>Oh, don't think lowly of them.</b>

14:46.590 --> 14:49.800
<b>When I got here,
all the adults were killed.</b>

14:56.730 --> 14:57.980
<b>They're all young children?</b>

14:59.730 --> 15:02.900
<b>You defeated the enemy three times
all on your own?</b>

15:03.480 --> 15:04.610
<b>No,</b>

15:04.690 --> 15:07.530
<b>-these ones come in handy in battle, too.
-<i>There they are!</i></b>

15:07.610 --> 15:10.660
<b>For example,
they distract the enemy with torches.</b>

15:10.740 --> 15:12.870
<b><i>Just you wait!</i></b>

15:12.950 --> 15:14.620
<b>And they dig pitfalls.</b>

15:21.380 --> 15:23.790
<b>They shoot the enemy
while using straw men as bait.</b>

15:25.300 --> 15:28.590
<b>Even young children can learn to fight
in many ways if only you teach them.</b>

15:29.970 --> 15:32.050
<b>I've been accumulating knowledge
and polishing my skills.</b>

15:32.640 --> 15:35.510
<b>I'm looking for a strong lord
who will put these skills to use.</b>

15:36.100 --> 15:40.730
<b>Although, I think it suits me better
to find and develop talent in others.</b>

15:42.060 --> 15:47.530
<b>If only I could find a lord
who is in need of instruction…</b>

15:51.070 --> 15:52.160
<b><i>How wonderful.</i></b>

15:54.410 --> 15:55.450
<b>HAND COMES OUT FROM THROAT</b>

16:20.350 --> 16:23.560
<b>This village is the most vital location
for Suwa?</b>

16:23.650 --> 16:26.020
<b>That's the first I've heard that.</b>

16:27.150 --> 16:29.360
<b>It's just that no one's realized it yet.</b>

16:30.030 --> 16:33.280
<b>The population of this village is small,
but it's a hard place to corner.</b>

16:34.280 --> 16:38.240
<b>If there are a hundred guards,
it morphs into an invincible fort.</b>

16:38.330 --> 16:39.490
<b>NAKAYAMA MANOR</b>

16:39.580 --> 16:41.710
<b>If Ogasawara were to occupy it
and place an army,</b>

16:41.790 --> 16:43.540
<b>then if he were to invade
from the borders,</b>

16:43.620 --> 16:45.210
<b>he would have a great advantage.</b>

16:46.040 --> 16:47.290
<b>ASADA MANOR - SUWA TERRITORY
OGASAWARA</b>

16:47.380 --> 16:49.510
<b>He could perform a two-front attack
on Suwa's Asada Manor,</b>

16:49.590 --> 16:50.960
<b>a bountiful and large settlement.</b>

16:51.920 --> 16:54.180
<b>In the art of war, it's called
a two-pronged attack.</b>

16:55.010 --> 16:56.050
<b>If this were to happen,</b>

16:56.140 --> 16:59.060
<b>Suwa would lose
a large portion of its territory.</b>

16:59.640 --> 17:00.640
<b>BUDDHA</b>

17:00.720 --> 17:03.770
<b>It seems the one
who will command the Ogasawara army</b>

17:04.270 --> 17:06.360
<b>fully understands this art of war.</b>

17:07.270 --> 17:12.740
<b>I thought that by communicating
the military value of this village,</b>

17:12.820 --> 17:14.990
<b>my reward for protecting it would be huge.</b>

17:16.780 --> 17:19.160
<b>Putting that aside, you sure do eat a lot!</b>

17:20.160 --> 17:22.580
<b>Also, don't use rice to plan strategy.</b>

17:22.660 --> 17:27.500
<b>Fubuki, you ate the village supply of food
in three days.</b>

17:27.580 --> 17:28.500
<b>What?</b>

17:28.590 --> 17:32.260
<b>Yes. So I thought I've reached my limit
of protecting the village.</b>

17:32.970 --> 17:34.840
<b>Here's the source of the village crisis.</b>

17:35.340 --> 17:37.300
<b>Your eye for strategy is amazing,</b>

17:37.390 --> 17:39.600
<b>but you can't calculate
how much food to eat.</b>

17:41.060 --> 17:43.060
<b>I wonder if it's because it's cold.</b>

17:43.810 --> 17:46.480
<b>I can't seem to warm up
no matter how much I eat.</b>

17:46.560 --> 17:50.860
<b>Speaking of which, I remember
when I first met you, Fubuki.</b>

17:54.610 --> 17:58.120
<b>You had snuck in
and eaten all the offerings.</b>

18:00.030 --> 18:03.200
<b>I had convinced our god that
a bear had snuck in,</b>

18:03.290 --> 18:04.450
<b>but it was troublesome.</b>

18:04.540 --> 18:07.620
<b>He was crying from how hungry he was.</b>

18:07.710 --> 18:11.500
<b><i>I wanted to eat abalone.</i></b>

18:11.590 --> 18:14.630
<b>I'm really sorry about that time.</b>

18:15.260 --> 18:19.430
<b>At any rate, I can't say no
to an empty stomach or to a small child.</b>

18:20.720 --> 18:22.140
<b>I have no dignity.</b>

18:30.610 --> 18:31.520
<b>Big Brother?</b>

18:32.320 --> 18:35.820
<b>Well, I thought he was
a rather calm and collected tactician,</b>

18:36.490 --> 18:39.490
<b>but he's surprisingly a clumsy person.</b>

18:40.160 --> 18:42.910
<b>A tactician would only be concerned
with winning.</b>

18:43.490 --> 18:45.910
<b>They wouldn't go through the trouble
of trying to protect a village</b>

18:46.000 --> 18:46.910
<b>with only small children.</b>

18:47.790 --> 18:51.750
<b><i>He's the one that rallied the children and</i>
<i>empowered them to protect their village.</i></b>

18:51.840 --> 18:54.630
<b><i>The children have just lost their parents,</i></b>

18:54.710 --> 18:58.300
<b><i>but their eyes sparkle</i>
<i>with the will to fight.</i></b>

18:59.130 --> 19:02.600
<b><i>I want his help to reclaim the throne!</i></b>

19:03.180 --> 19:06.100
<b>I also want Fubuki
to secretly teach me to fight</b>

19:06.180 --> 19:08.940
<b>so that Kojiro and Ayako
will look at me with respect!</b>

19:10.690 --> 19:11.900
<b>By the way, Big Brother.</b>

19:12.900 --> 19:14.940
<b>-I'm wondering why Father…
-<i>The future.</i></b>

19:15.030 --> 19:16.280
<b>…was strangely worried.</b>

19:16.360 --> 19:17.400
<b><i>The future!</i></b>

19:17.490 --> 19:20.160
<b>He may not be able to see a future
where you are safe.</b>

19:21.570 --> 19:25.580
<b>No matter how important this village is,
your life is too.</b>

19:26.200 --> 19:28.870
<b>I suggest we abandon the village
for now and run away,</b>

19:28.960 --> 19:32.330
<b>taking the children somewhere safe
in Suwa territory.</b>

19:40.220 --> 19:42.970
<b>No. I want to protect the village too,
if I can help it.</b>

19:43.550 --> 19:47.680
<b>It seems the children's parents
haven't had a proper burial yet.</b>

19:48.430 --> 19:52.150
<b>It's a bit much for them to lose
their home and their parents all at once.</b>

19:53.020 --> 19:56.900
<b>I want them to be able to stay here
while their hearts find peace.</b>

19:59.360 --> 20:00.360
<b>Big Brother…</b>

20:01.490 --> 20:02.410
<b>Fubuki.</b>

20:06.240 --> 20:11.170
<b>Will you let us aid you with your battle?</b>

20:18.920 --> 20:23.640
<b>I would be honored if you fought with us.</b>

20:38.690 --> 20:45.410
<b>Sir, won't that Sadamune guy be mad
that we killed so many villagers?</b>

20:49.870 --> 20:51.120
<b>He won't mind.</b>

20:51.750 --> 20:55.960
<b>It would be wrong of him to expect
morality from a former scoundrel.</b>

20:56.040 --> 20:57.040
<b>On top of that…</b>

20:58.090 --> 21:00.050
<b>Namu Amida Butsu.</b>

21:02.300 --> 21:08.010
<b>If you say that,
Buddha will forgive all your misdeeds.</b>

21:08.100 --> 21:09.220
<b>Isn't that convenient?</b>

21:12.940 --> 21:15.690
<b>Buddha is the best!</b>

21:18.520 --> 21:20.900
<b>The Seigi Party is composed of
only the mightiest warriors,</b>

21:20.980 --> 21:24.150
<b>so it only takes five of us
to destroy one village.</b>

21:24.240 --> 21:27.320
<b>On three separate ambushes,</b>

21:27.410 --> 21:31.290
<b>our warriors didn't return
from that settlement.</b>

21:39.630 --> 21:41.090
<b>Help me!</b>

21:52.640 --> 21:57.730
<b>It doesn't seem I can drink the fine sake
of plunder by being a thief.</b>

21:59.900 --> 22:03.440
<b>Let's become warriors again and fight.</b>

23:39.040 --> 23:39.870
<b>EPISODE 8 (YEAR OF 1334):
A WAR OF HIDE AND SEEK</b>

23:39.040 --> 23:39.870
<b><i>Let's go!</i></b>
